{"assets":["/statement-assets/c3d2f5fb5abbf7fcaeea3c7153a47b5fb21a90912b03cc3cd01a762a2d2048eb.png","/statement-assets/1fb8dbc12703784d4bcd7b88e8c15e39b2d46da231900e726da3c136d8930b5f.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1360","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Polygon"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polygon is not only the best platform for developing problems but also a square matrix with side $$$n$$$, initially filled with the character "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the polygon, military training was held. The soldiers placed a cannon above each cell in the first row and a cannon to the left of each cell in the first column. Thus, exactly $$$2n$$$ cannons were placed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c3d2f5fb5abbf7fcaeea3c7153a47b5fb21a90912b03cc3cd01a762a2d2048eb.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initial polygon for $$$n=4$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Cannons shoot character "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". At any moment of time, no more than one cannon is shooting. When a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" flies out of a cannon, it flies forward (in the direction of the shot) until it collides with a polygon border or another "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that, it takes the cell in which it was before the collision and remains there. Take a look at the examples for better understanding."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"More formally: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if a cannon stands in the row $$$i$$$, to the left of the first column, and shoots with a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" starts its flight from the cell ($$$i, 1$$$) and ends in some cell ($$$i, j$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if a cannon stands in the column $$$j$$$, above the first row, and shoots with a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" starts its flight from the cell ($$$1, j$$$) and ends in some cell ($$$i, j$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, consider the following sequence of shots:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1fb8dbc12703784d4bcd7b88e8c15e39b2d46da231900e726da3c136d8930b5f.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1. Shoot the cannon in the row $$$2$$$.                         2. Shoot the cannon in the row $$$2$$$.                         3. Shoot the cannon in column $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a report from the military training on your desk. This report is a square matrix with side length $$$n$$$ consisting of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". You wonder if the training actually happened. In other words, is there a sequence of shots such that, after the training, you get the given matrix?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each cannon can make an arbitrary number of shots. Before the training, each cell of the polygon contains "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$) — the number of test cases. Then $$$t$$$ test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case starts with a line containing an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 50$$$) — the size of the polygon."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is followed by $$$n$$$ lines of length $$$n$$$, consisting of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the polygon matrix after the training."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The total area of the matrices in all test cases in one test does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case print:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is a sequence of shots leading to a given matrix; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if such a sequence does not exist. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The letters in the words "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" can be printed in any case."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4\n0010\n0011\n0000\n0000\n2\n10\n01\n2\n00\n00\n4\n0101\n1111\n0101\n0111\n4\n0100\n1110\n0101\n0111\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first test case was explained in the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The answer to the second test case is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", since a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in a cell ($$$1, 1$$$) flying out of any cannon would continue its flight further."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1360E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1360/problem/E"}